{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-14_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-14",
  "title": "“我們”",
  "storyCode": "13-16",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-14_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "85ceba9403209c30b4b742f7172bb9699b921b57bf71b041505be01b3d8d66b5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "好消息，還是壞消息？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷德",
      "text": "好消息是，那個作坊確實還完整，它藏在森林裡，沒被薩卡茲或者大公爵搶下當作兵營。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷德",
      "text": "壞消息是，裡面有人居住，我們看到了燈光。我靠近了那裡，表明了身份，燈光卻熄滅了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "可能是難民，或者逃兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "熄滅燈光……他們對我們警惕性很高。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動戰士",
      "text": "我們做好準備了，我們的戰士足以應付大多數的情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "不，先不著急，熄滅燈光也可能僅僅是出於謹慎，或者害怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "別太早下定論。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "況且，雷德背著那麼長一把刀，任誰都會加倍小心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我去吧，我去和他們談談。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "你一個人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "夠了，人越多，他們越緊張。況且，如果那些人真的有敵意，也不會因為我們去了幾個人而變化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "南邊的天空從前幾天開始一直是殷紅色，珀茜瓦爾他們之前還發現過一座奇怪的法陣……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我們必須把握時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "……這有一定風險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "但我們從切爾諾伯格走出來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "text": "我們會在外圍準備好接應，隨時突圍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "那邊在被維多利亞的整合運動佔領之前，是個私酒廠，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我已經聞到酒精的味道了。羅曼內奇會喜歡的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你好，有人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你好，我叫Guard，我們的隊伍就在附近，你們之前已經發現他們了，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "別緊張，我們沒有敵意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "這個作坊曾經是維多利亞整合運動的製藥工坊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "這裡曾經給很多倫蒂尼姆附近的感染者帶去了希望，這裡的藥物甚至在倫蒂尼姆那些工業區下水道裡的工人們之間流通。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "不論你們是誰，你們都知道，這場戰爭在催生大量的感染者，比以往多得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我們想要重新運轉這裡，這能幫助到很多人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "既然你們已經佔據了這裡……\n我們需要你們的協助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我們可以提供藥物，或者其他物資，這是一場合理的交易。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動？",
      "text": "整合運動，嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "這身衣服……你是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動？",
      "text": "梅斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "進來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "別看了，讓開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你是這裡的負責人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "這裡歸我管。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我們找個沒人的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "就這裡吧，平常沒人會來這。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "所以，你是整合運動，貨真價實的整合運動，你們從北方來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "……烏薩斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "是的，烏薩斯，哥倫比亞，現在我們到了維多利亞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "不近。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你的這身衣服是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我……自己用床單改的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我以前遇到過一批烏薩斯人，他們說你們就是這副打扮。我應該沒弄錯標誌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "似乎有點大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "……你是來嘲笑我的手藝的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "所以你才管住了這裡，畢竟你穿了身兇名在外的“整合運動”的衣服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "直入主題吧，我的時間不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "你們想重新運轉這間作坊？想用這些罐子製藥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "是的，如果這裡重新被整合運動掌控的消息能在周圍傳開……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "這裡的情況比你們想像的複雜，這裡什麼人都有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "每天感染者和非感染者打的架就已經鬧得我心力交瘁了，幫感染者製藥？你乾脆直接炸了這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "他們之間的平衡很難維持。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你是個整合運動，對吧？起碼自稱是個整合運動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "大概吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你們遇到了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "還能是什麼，無家可歸的感染者，戰爭難民，失去了一切的人，我們總需要一個能夠遮風避雨的屋檐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我和另外幾個感染者是最先來的。我們發現了這裡有間破房子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "後來人越來越多，也來了些……很不老實的傢伙。現在，我們不收外人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "能看到你們，整合運動的同伴，我很高興。但我不想讓這裡的人懷疑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "懷疑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "懷疑現在我和你正在密謀清理掉我們之中的那些非感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "不管是不是你騙我們開門的藉口，我們可以交換物資。但在此之外的……免談。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "……這裡還有很多非感染者，那麼我理解你的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "但我仍然建議你能和這裡的人們商量一下再做決定，只要這裡的藥物生產能夠重啟，我們可以達成長期的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "不，不用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "現在，離開吧。見到你很高興。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "你們要打下這裡，也可以。只要你們打得下來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "喂，整合運動！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "塔露拉在你們的隊伍裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "……是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我聽說，她有一座移動城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "她的移動城市裡，只接受感染者嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "沒感染的人，能去那裡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我聽整……以前路過的商隊說起過，那裡是個好地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我——我們這裡，有一些境況不太好的人，出身荒野的流民，再無親人的孤兒，說起整合運動的城市，大家都眉飛色舞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "……可是，你們只和感染者站在一起，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "……城市？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "可能有一些誤會——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "梅斯！你到底知不知道他們幹的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "是不是你讓他們幹的！你瘋了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "你在說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "他們——那幫蠢貨！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "那個人也許是個正在這裡打仗的士兵！或者是個什麼會惹來麻煩的大人物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "也許，兩個小時之後，就會有一大批武裝到牙齒的薩卡茲把我們都殺光！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "到底怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "你……你也是個和梅斯一樣的整合運動？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "都是你，你們的人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "那些感染者，在倉庫裡打死了一個薩卡茲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "該死！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "他……他也是感染者，會炸，對吧？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "我們得把那傢伙處理掉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我需要去看看情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "那，快點！你應該能幫得上忙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的感染者",
      "text": "他……他死了。薩卡茲也沒有很強壯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的感染者",
      "text": "給你……他身上的藥，和硬麵包。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的感染者",
      "text": "活該。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的感染者",
      "text": "你！你是整合運動，對不對？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的感染者",
      "text": "之前梅斯一直不告訴我們加入你們的辦法！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你們為什麼打他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "他脅迫了你們嗎？他試圖攻擊你們嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的感染者",
      "text": "哦，為什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的感染者",
      "text": "薩卡茲燒我們的農場，凌辱我的女兒的時候，問過為什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "……他不是軍人，他不是什麼從卡茲戴爾來的殺人魔，他確實就是個在這片戰場上倒賣東西的流浪者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你們……甚至接受過他的幫助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的感染者",
      "text": "喂，怎麼回事？他也是整合運動？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我“是”整合運動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "……那你們應該知道整合運動為什麼而戰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的感染者",
      "text": "當然，你們整合運動是為了幫所有感染者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "這個被你們折磨至死的人，這個還沒來得及給自己起名字的人……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "他難道不是個感染者嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的感染者",
      "text": "可他是個薩卡茲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "喂，Guard，他的屍體……在發光，他快要崩解了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "離開這裡！立刻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷漠的感染者",
      "text": "跑——跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "梅斯！你們這裡怎麼處理感染者？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "那個房間，那個最裡面的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "快，我們得把他扔進去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "該死，該死……我得後退一點，防護……防護，口鼻，還有傷口——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "不行，走，走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "你幹什麼？！你怎麼把屍體——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "這裡的源石沉積太嚴重了，這裡到底處理過多少感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我……以前——那些年都是在這間房間！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "源石粉塵已經揚起來了，這裡已經沒辦法再承受一次這麼猛烈的崩解了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "立刻讓所有人離開這裡，立刻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "……什、什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你聽不懂嗎？這裡的源石環境已經極端不穩定，隨時有引發爆炸的可能！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "離開？去哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的難民",
      "text": "外面都是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "別廢話！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "這些人可是真正的整合運動，他們有一座*維多利亞粗口*的移動城市！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "跑起來，讓所有的人都跑起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我已經聯絡了我們在外圍的隊伍，他們會接收這裡的人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "嘖，這裡的蒸餾器裡還有殘餘的烈酒，如果爆炸，這裡會被燒得一乾二淨！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "那個東西——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "喂，梅斯，你要去哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "你來幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我正在——唔——幫我扳一下那個操縱桿——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你是這個作坊的成員？但你不是感染者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "謝謝你沒有拆穿我！唔——再用力！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你這件整合運動的衣服是哪來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "這裡曾經是整合運動的據點，這裡死過很多人——我的耐心不多！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我——我什麼都沒做！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "每個人都這麼說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我以前是……這裡的操作工，那些整合運動佔領了酒廠，他們要人為他們操作這些機器！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我……只是，那些領主雇來的傭兵突襲了這裡，我逃了……我確實不是感染者，我為什麼要和那些整合運動一起死在這裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "那你為什麼回來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "為什麼要回來？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "因為我無處可去！該死，還能有什麼原因，淪落到在私酒廠裡賣命的人，還能有什麼地方可以去？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我沒感染，可我有的時候，寧願自己是個整合運動！他們，他們起碼有可以反抗的東西，他們起碼有個目標！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "再用力——這操縱桿，卡住了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "先把這玩意——卸料口的開關打開，曾經在這裡的那些整合運動，他們留在這裡的原料還剩下不少！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "那醫生告訴過我，這是他們嘗試了很久的，最廉價的止痛劑配方，只能止痛，但也夠了，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "用這個……我能換個真正的整合運動資格嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "我想……我也許可以在你們的移動城市裡，分間房子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我們並沒有移動城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "可是，那些整合運動都說——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "可是你們……可……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "……哈哈……也是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "那可是……移動城市，一座城市，我們……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "帶好這些草藥，我們馬上離開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你其實不用申請加入整合運動，只要你願意和我們並肩作戰，你就已經是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "可……我不是感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "想要反抗的人也未必只有感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "還有，我需要你幫助我指認那些殺了那個薩卡茲的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "他們需要受到懲罰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "跑起來，快點！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "前面就是出口了，加快腳步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅斯",
      "text": "啊！我的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "拿去……收好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "出口就在前面，這次別再撒了，有些花瓣可能……被我捏碎了，把它們給一個叫九的人，她有辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "別再猶豫了，快點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "九，雷德，珀茜瓦爾，塔露拉，呃哈……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我不確定你們找到我的時候，我有沒有被火燒成灰，但願這個錄音機能留得下來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "你們說——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "我們為所有的“感染者”而戰嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "哪怕他們是無恥者，是上位者，甚至……是帝王？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "或者說……我們所團結的人，我們希望與之並肩披荊斬棘的人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "只有感染者嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "只有……他們嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
